    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To The Entwine is a rouge-lite bullet hell, Focused on combat and exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a post-apocalyptic world in this action packed rouge-lite bullet hell. Uncover the secrets of the world's downfall in the single-player story mode or fight through hordes of enemies and explore the desolate landscape collecting vital research along the way in rouge-lite mode </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight hordes of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Research to learn about the past</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the story of what caused the apocalyptic event</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise your gun with various mods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden collectables to find throughout the levels</p></li></ul>",
